dialect protocol
protocol stdio.docx.diff
version 1
schema stdio.docx
start record

# FG-wave: REAL binary diff frame, replacing F6's `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary
# shortcut (`../../🦀️.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`/`decode_diff`) -- per this
# ticket's own `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §4/§6 census, 100% of stdio's `DiffCodec` impls were still on
# this shortcut before this pilot ladder. `format u8` + `flags u8` (bit0 = `opc` present, bit1 =
# `document` present -- `DocxDiff` has exactly these TWO independently-optional top-level fields)
# as two REAL fixed fields, individually protocol-walked -- same shape
# `📰️xml/…/🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio`'s own `flags` header uses (restated here,
# per-artifact bit assignment).
#
# Past that header, `opc`/`document` (whichever `flags` marks present, in that FIXED order) are
# bundled into ONE opaque trailing `bytes` chain: `DocxOpcDiff`/`DocxDocumentDiff` both recurse
# into genuinely data-carrying, recursive structures (`DocxBlockDiff`'s `Table` variant nests back
# through `rows`/`cells`/`blocks` to its OWN `IndexedTripleDiff` collection triple) -- the SAME
# `protocol-prim-ref-recursion` mechanism gap every other stdio artifact's diff payload hits
# (`Prim::Ref` unconditionally errors in `walk_protocol`, confirmed unchanged through every pilot,
# `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §5). This dialect's `Cond` also cannot test an individual FLAG BIT (only a
# field's whole value against a literal), so a per-bit-guarded field list isn't expressible even
# before the recursion is considered -- bundling both fields into one opaque tail, rather than
# partially structuring only the non-recursive-looking one, is the honest, minimal-surface choice.
#
# The Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` side stays genuinely, fully structured past this header --
# real LEB128-varint-framed collection counts, per-field 1-byte tri-state presence tags, and
# recursive per-variant binary sub-encoders for `DocxBlock`/`DocxBlockDiff`/`DocxStyle`/
# `DocxStyleDiff`/`OpcPart`/`DocxOpcPartDiff`/`OpcRelationship`/`DocxOpcRelDiff`/`XmlNode` (see
# `../../🦀️.rs`'s own `BinaryPrimitives`/`ValueBinaryCodecs`/`GenericTripleBinaryCodecs`/
# `DiffValueBinaryCodecs` regions) -- round-trip tested independently of this protocol
# description, same honest-boundary treatment `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §2.5 documents.
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field flags u8
chain payload bytes
